        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/thefacility/_scene_polarbear_005.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 579f2544-1970-4865-afa3-ad4566e5f98d).Image",
        "Description": "Agent, thanks for stealing that helicopter. We sold it, so now we can afford WiFi and cover our minor assault lawsuits. With WiFi, I can finally get back to playing my favorite game, Chess on Chess.com. Unfortunately, Jasper Knight beat me in a 5-minute speed chess match and stole 8 precious ELO points. Your mission: eliminate Jasper so I automatically win the rematch. Also, humiliate him by solving his chess puzzle, then drown him in a toilet! MUAHAHAHAHA!",
